   178	            // If our cursor is on this line then we break the run around the
   179	            // cursor. This means that any row with a cursor has at least
   180	            // three breaks: before, exactly the cursor, and after.
   181	            //
   182	            // We do not break a cell that is exactly the grapheme. If there
   183	            // are cells following that contain joiners, we allow those to
   184	            // break. This creates an effect where hovering over an emoji
